  "limitations": [
    "The model depicts the January 2009 exterior of the museum on Rosario de Santa Fe and Ituzaingó.",
    "The municipal parcels constrain the street corner and total extent. The Qualla photo controls the principal portal, barred windows and whitewashed eave. The heritage records inform the corner balcony and five patios. The exact interior roof divisions and unseen elevations are estimates.",
    "The original Terrarium field is preserved. Pavement registration and terrace height are approximate."
  ],
